    "body": "\n    <header class=\"legal-nav\">\n      <div class=\"legal-nav-inner\">\n        <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/#top\" aria-label=\"Nimbus VFX home\">Nimbus VFX</a>\n        <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Legal page navigation\">\n          <a href=\"/#proof\">Work</a>\n          <a href=\"/#audit\">Audit</a>\n          <a href=\"mailto:Daniel@NimbusVFX.com\">Contact</a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n      <section class=\"legal-hero\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Cookie Policy</p>\n        <h1>No hidden ad stack on this site.</h1>\n        <p class=\"hero-copy\">\n          This policy explains how NimbusVFX.com uses cookies, similar technologies, hosting logs, fonts, and third-party links. The current public site is designed to be lightweight and does not intentionally use advertising pixels or behavioral tracking.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"meta-row\" aria-label=\"Policy metadata\">\n          <span class=\"meta-pill\">Effective: July 30, 2026</span>\n          <span class=\"meta-pill\">No intentional ad pixels</span>\n          <span class=\"meta-pill\">NimbusVFX.com</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"legal-layout\">\n        <aside class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"Cookie policy sections\">\n          <strong>Sections</strong>\n          <a href=\"#cookies\">Cookies</a>\n          <a href=\"#current-use\">Current use</a>\n          <a href=\"#categories\">Categories</a>\n          <a href=\"#third-parties\">Third parties</a>\n          <a href=\"#choices\">Choices</a>\n          <a href=\"#changes\">Changes</a>\n        </aside>\n\n        <article class=\"legal-content\">\n          <section class=\"policy-section\" id=\"cookies\">\n            <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>\n            <p>\n              Cookies are small files stored on a browser or device. Similar technologies include local storage, pixels, tags, SDKs, server logs, and device identifiers. They can help a website load, remember choices, measure performance, secure traffic, or support advertising.\n            </p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section class=\"policy-section\" id=\"current-use\">\n            <h2>2. Current Nimbus VFX website use</h2>\n            <p>\n              NimbusVFX.com is currently an informational website. Based on the current implementation, Nimbus VFX does not intentionally place advertising cookies, retargeting pixels, or behavioral analytics scripts on the public homepage.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              The site may still generate ordinary technical data when it loads, including hosting logs, IP address, browser type, device type, page requests, timestamps, referring pages, and error logs. Managed hosting and content delivery providers may process this information to deliver pages, protect infrastructure, diagnose issues, and maintain performance.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              The site uses externally hosted web fonts. When those font resources are requested, the font provider may receive technical request information such as IP address, browser details, and the page requesting the font.\n            </p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section class=\"policy-section\" id=\"categories\">\n            <h2>3. Cookie categories</h2>\n            <p>If Nimbus VFX adds cookie-based tooling later, it will generally fall into these categories:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li><strong>Strictly necessary:</strong> required for page delivery, security, fraud prevention, load balancing, consent management, or core site operation.</li>\n              <li><strong>Preference:</strong> used to remember choices such as consent settings, region, display preferences, or saved form state.</li>\n              <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> used to understand aggregate traffic, page performance, visitor paths, and content effectiveness.</li>\n              <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> used for advertising, retargeting, campaign measurement, or cross-site audience building. These are not intentionally used on the current public site.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section class=\"policy-section\" id=\"third-parties\">\n            <h2>4. Third-party links and platforms</h2>\n            <p>\n              NimbusVFX.com links to third-party platforms such as LinkedIn, X, TikTok, YouTube, and Instagram. Clicking those links may allow those platforms to collect information under their own policies. Nimbus VFX does not control those platforms.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              If future pages embed videos, forms, scheduling tools, analytics, CRM tools, or social media widgets, those services may use cookies or similar technologies. Nimbus VFX will update this policy when those tools materially change visitor tracking.\n            </p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section class=\"policy-section\" id=\"choices\">\n            <h2>5. Your choices</h2>\n            <p>You can control cookies and similar technologies in several ways:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Use browser settings to block, delete, or restrict cookies.</li>\n              <li>Use browser privacy features, private browsing, tracker prevention, or extension-based controls.</li>\n              <li>Use device or platform privacy settings where available.</li>\n              <li>Email <a href=\"mailto:Daniel@NimbusVFX.com\">Daniel@NimbusVFX.com</a> with questions about Nimbus VFX website tracking.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>\n              Blocking strictly necessary technologies may affect whether a website loads correctly. Blocking third-party resources may affect fonts, media, embedded tools, or social links.\n            </p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section class=\"policy-section\" id=\"changes\">\n            <h2>6. Changes</h2>\n            <p>\n              Nimbus VFX may update this Cookie Policy if the website adds analytics, forms, scheduling, embedded video, client portals, ad measurement, consent tooling, or other features that change cookie behavior.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Questions can be sent to <a href=\"mailto:Daniel@NimbusVFX.com\">Daniel@NimbusVFX.com</a>.\n            </p>\n          </section>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"legal-footer\">\n      <div class=\"legal-footer-inner\">\n        <span>© 2026 Nimbus VFX. All rights reserved.</span>\n        <nav class=\"footer-links\" aria-label=\"Legal footer links\">\n          <a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>\n          <a href=\"/terms-of-use\">Terms of Use</a>\n          <a href=\"/security\">Security</a>\n          <a href=\"/cookie-policy\">Cookies</a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  ",
